<p>{{ name ? `Hi ${name},` : 'Hi,' }}</p>

<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password for your
  {{ brandName }}
  account. To choose a new one, use this link:
</p>

<p><a href="{{ resetUrl }}">Choose a new password</a></p>

<p>
  The link works for
  {{ lifetime }}
  and can be used once. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email and your password will stay as it is.
</p>
